- activity_answer_no_replay: already answered row returns answered.
- activity_answer_authorized: wrong signer returns notResumer.
- activity_response_matches_plan: other response tag returns plan.
- activity_retire_needs_answer: pending row returns unanswered.
- activity_retire_after_answer: answered row returns ok.
