Every theorem below: LANDED statements gaining premises none; LANDED statements restated none.
No new conclusion contains an Or escape branch. Existentials are actual values returned by the collector/evaluator.
holeCoverageCheck_application: exact emitted-code refinement of P10 collect for all eight Boolean coverage inputs; no success premise.
holeCoverageOutcome_ok_iff: collect returns exactly when every declared role was observed; all missing cases inhabited.
holePointCovered_meaning: actual point key equality for arbitrary optional row points, cell bytes and version; independent of value presence.
holeCheckedJudge_application: actual production wrapper composition, local operand evaluations only; exact refusal/success result, not an assumed judgment.
holeCheckedAdmission_evaluated_iff: gate succeeds exactly when all coverage flags hold and current label verified; nondeterministic alternate success excluded.
hole_judgment_admission_bridge: actual checked segment iff collection success AND current world judge; only provided observations authenticated, completeness not assumed. Both iff directions read.
hole_judgment_admission_fixed_observations: specialization/corollary for complete observations; deliberate corollary, not an additional coverage claim.
holeJudge_fixed_observations: predecessor theorem with original mathematical type/proof, renamed raw helper; does not certify receive by itself.
hole_omitted_support0_refused: missing first dependency reaches exact role refusal, not suspended status.
hole_omitted_support1_refused: missing second dependency reaches exact role refusal.
hole_omitted_blocker_refused: missing negative dependency refuses pruned before status.
hole_conflict_requires_observation: false clause cannot skip blocker coverage.
hole_observed_absent_blocker_releases: genuine absent row yields verified status; rejects always-refuse.
hole_observed_absent_support_records: absent positive support yields retained negative status, not missing-observation refusal.
hole_observed_live_blocker_records: live blocker yields retained pruned status; rejects refusing all negative judgments.
hole_coverage_follows_keys: permuted support/blocker rows still yield verified; rules out position-based readings.
hole_unrelated_row_is_not_coverage: observed other key does not cover blocker; equality bypass mutation refutes it.
